n","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T18:53:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:04:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124554","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124554.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124554.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #124553\n\n## Additional information\nThe fix here is really straightforward, it seems like it was an oversight that when copying the animation tracks and loop mode from the old file to the new file that the markers were forgotten.\n\nThe only notable thing about the fix is the `const StringName marker_name : old_anim->get_marker_names()` not using a reference. Right now `get_marker_names()` returns a `PackedStringArray` and has a comment noting that it should be changed to a `TypedArray<StringName>`. Since right now we have to do a String -> StringName conversion anyway for the `has_marker`/`add_marker`/etc calls it makes sense to do it once there instead of looping using `const String& marker_name`. If `get_marker_names()` ever gets that update, we could change this to `const StringName& marker_name` and save a StringName copy.\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124554/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}